SUMMARY:EduCore — ADR-012 Exception Review (Identity & Tenant)
DESCRIPTION:EDUCORE GOVERNANCE — ADR-012 EXCEPTION REVIEW\n\nPurpose:\nReview the time-bounded Identity & Tenant architecture exception (ADR-012) under Conditional Freeze. Confirm countersignature status. Decide Renew / Amend / Expire path. Agree path to DBF-001 and ACF-001 Freeze v1.0 before hard expiry 2026-09-15.\n\nIMPORTANT:\n• This meeting does NOT accept Database Freeze v1.0 or API Contract Freeze v1.0.\n• This meeting does NOT authorize tenant/user CRUD or role-admin product APIs.\n• Platform AuthN (/api/v1/auth/*) and RBAC foundation may already exist under the exception — residual production readiness remains open.\n\nRequired attendees:\n• Principal Architect / Governance Lead (Host) — governance.lead@educore.local\n• PM Master — Database Architect — pm.master@educore.local\n• Masoud Salum — Security Lead — masoud.salum@educore.local\n• Rashid Mohammed — Backend Lead — rashid.mohammed@educore.local\n\nPre-read (before the meeting):\n1) docs/engineering/governance/ADR-012_ONE_PAGE_SUMMARY.md\n2) docs/engineering/decisions/ADR-012-exception-identity-tenant-implementation.md\n3) docs/engineering/governance/IDENTITY_TENANT_GOVERNANCE_COMPLETION_PLAN.md\n4) docs/engineering/gates/FREEZE_ACCEPTANCE_IDENTITY_TENANT.md\n\nCountersign ADR-012 by Friday 2026-08-08 (before this meeting if possible).\nSignature phrase: Countersigned — exception only; Freeze v1.0 still pending\n\nAgenda (75 minutes):\n00–10  Framing: exception ≠ Freeze v1.0 (Host)\n10–20  Countersignature status (Host)\n20–35  Security residuals — RLS\, live evidence\, product surface (Masoud Salum)\n35–50  Schema / DBF fidelity & rework risk (PM Master)\n50–60  Backend scope control & AuthN/RBAC vs closed CRUD (Rashid Mohammed)\n60–70  Decision: Renew / Amend / Expire + Freeze v1.0 path by 2026-09-01 (All)\n70–75  Actions\, owners\, minutes (Host)\n\nRequired outcomes:\n• Recorded decision (Renew / Amend / Expire)\n• Named follow-ups with owners and dates\n• Explicit product HTTP NO GO (CRUD/admin) statement in minutes\n\nBinding ADR review-by date: 2026-08-15\nHard expiry if not renewed or freezes completed: 2026-09-15\nAlternate slot if needed: Tuesday 2026-08-12\, 14:00–15:15 EAT\n\nVideo: replace LOCATION below with real Teams/Meet/Zoom URL before send if still TBD.
LOCATION:Video conference — Video link TBD (replace with Teams/Meet/Zoom URL before send)
